        "caption": {
          "zh": "1890年4–5月 · 伦敦国家美术馆",
          "en": "April–May 1890 · The National Gallery, London"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT I",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第一幕 · 最后的春天",
          "en": "The last spring"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "1890年春天，梵高在圣雷米疗养院已经住了将近一年。他走进花园，画下了一片长满草的角落。",
          "en": "In spring 1890, Van Gogh had been at the Saint-Rémy asylum for almost a year. He went out into the garden and painted an overgrown corner."
        }
      },
      {
        "image": "images/long-grass-butterflies.jpg",
